    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1112">

                <pb facs="1296" n="1100" sameAs="frus:frus1945Berlinv02/pg1100"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00119 Control (Italy)/7–1745: Telegram</note>
                <head>No. 1112<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the
                        Ambassador in Italy</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Kirk</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi></seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1945-07-19T16:00:00-04:00">July 19, 1945—4 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1205. Dept has not yet received British concurrence (urtel 2010, July 17<anchor
                        n="1" xml:id="d1112-f1"/>) in appointment of Douglas as Chief Commissioner
                    of AC.</p>
                <closer><signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Grew</hi>
                        <lb/> S[amuel] R[eber] </signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
